OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for racially aggravated
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for 18 months
OL,7,Fafter he threatened to kill staff and
OL,8,Fstudents at Bradford College with
OL,9,Fgarden secateurs during a tirade of
OL,10,Fracial abuse.
OL,12,FBradford Crown Court was told David
OL,13,FNoutch, 32, had approached students
OL,14,Foutside the college on Great Horton
OL,15,FRoad on 9 October 2025 while
OL,16,Fintoxicated. He started a fight before
OL,17,Fthreatening security guards, directing
OL,18,Fracial abuse at staff and attempting to
OL,19,Fattack them with the shears.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
