OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for racially aggravated
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FNoutch, of no fixed abode, pleaded
OL,7,Fguilty in June to racially aggravated
OL,8,Fassault, racially aggravated fear of
OL,9,Fviolence and threatening a person with
OL,10,Fa blade in a public place.
OL,12,FHe was sentenced on Wednesday to 18.5
OL,13,Fmonths in jail and 18.5 months on
OL,14,Flicence.
